{"audio": "narracion.mp3", "duracion": 52.11, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.0, "fin": 5.58, "texto": "¿Qué tienen en común una silla vacía y una meta del Gobierno? Más de lo que crees.", "palabras": [{"w": "¿Qué", "ini": 0.0, "fin": 0.18}, {"w": "tienen", "ini": 0.18, "fin": 0.46}, {"w": "en", "ini": 0.46, "fin": 0.64}, {"w": "común", "ini": 0.64, "fin": 0.96}, {"w": "una", "ini": 0.96, "fin": 1.44}, {"w": "silla", "ini": 1.44, "fin": 1.76}, {"w": "vacía", "ini": 1.76, "fin": 2.34}, {"w": "y", "ini": 2.34, "fin": 2.66}, {"w": "una", "ini": 2.66, "fin": 2.86}, {"w": "meta", "ini": 2.86, "fin": 3.2}, {"w": "del", "ini": 3.2, "fin": 3.4}, {"w": "Gobierno?", "ini": 3.4, "fin": 3.72}, {"w": "Más", "ini": 4.42, "fin": 4.8}, {"w": "de", "ini": 4.8, "fin": 4.92}, {"w": "lo", "ini": 4.92, "fin": 5.02}, {"w": "que", "ini": 5.02, "fin": 5.14}, {"w": "crees.", "ini": 5.14, "fin": 5.58}]}, {"ini": 6.1, "fin": 9.2, "texto": "Esta silla vacía es el desempleo: un problema.", "palabras": [{"w": "Esta", "ini": 6.1, "fin": 6.34}, {"w": "silla", "ini": 6.34, "fin": 6.58}, {"w": "vacía", "ini": 6.58, "fin": 7.12}, {"w": "es", "ini": 7.12, "fin": 7.46}, {"w": "el", "ini": 7.46, "fin": 7.6}, {"w": "desempleo:", "ini": 7.6, "fin": 8.24}, {"w": "un", "ini": 8.62, "fin": 8.78}, {"w": "problema.", "ini": 8.78, "fin": 9.2}]}, {"ini": 9.88, "fin": 14.96, "texto": "Ahora voltéala: alguien está trabajando en ella. Reducir el desempleo.", "palabras": [{"w": "Ahora", "ini": 9.88, "fin": 10.12}, {"w": "voltéala:", "ini": 10.12, "fin": 10.74}, {"w": "alguien", "ini": 11.28, "fin": 11.7}, {"w": "está", "ini": 11.7, "fin": 12.0}, {"w": "trabajando", "ini": 12.0, "fin": 12.36}, {"w": "en", "ini": 12.36, "fin": 12.7}, {"w": "ella.", "ini": 12.7, "fin": 12.94}, {"w": "Reducir", "ini": 13.6, "fin": 14.16}, {"w": "el", "ini": 14.16, "fin": 14.26}, {"w": "desempleo.", "ini": 14.26, "fin": 14.96}]}, {"ini": 15.3, "fin": 20.26, "texto": "Eso es un objetivo: el problema, escrito como si ya estuviera resuelto.", "palabras": [{"w": "Eso", "ini": 15.3, "fin": 15.62}, {"w": "es", "ini": 15.62, "fin": 15.96}, {"w": "un", "ini": 15.96, "fin": 16.08}, {"w": "objetivo:", "ini": 16.08, "fin": 16.38}, {"w": "el", "ini": 17.0, "fin": 17.12}, {"w": "problema,", "ini": 17.12, "fin": 17.56}, {"w": "escrito", "ini": 17.98, "fin": 18.4}, {"w": "como", "ini": 18.4, "fin": 18.72}, {"w": "si", "ini": 18.72, "fin": 18.96}, {"w": "ya", "ini": 18.96, "fin": 19.24}, {"w": "estuviera", "ini": 19.24, "fin": 19.68}, {"w": "resuelto.", "ini": 19.68, "fin": 20.26}]}, {"ini": 20.74, "fin": 24.8, "texto": "Mira: la desigualdad se voltea en redistribuir la renta.", "palabras": [{"w": "Mira:", "ini": 20.74, "fin": 20.98}, {"w": "la", "ini": 21.56, "fin": 21.7}, {"w": "desigualdad", "ini": 21.7, "fin": 22.38}, {"w": "se", "ini": 22.38, "fin": 22.58}, {"w": "voltea", "ini": 22.58, "fin": 23.1}, {"w": "en", "ini": 23.1, "fin": 23.32}, {"w": "redistribuir", "ini": 23.32, "fin": 24.1}, {"w": "la", "ini": 24.1, "fin": 24.36}, {"w": "renta.", "ini": 24.36, "fin": 24.8}]}, {"ini": 25.24, "fin": 28.0, "texto": "Los recursos mal asignados, en asignarlos bien.", "palabras": [{"w": "Los", "ini": 25.24, "fin": 25.38}, {"w": "recursos", "ini": 25.38, "fin": 25.82}, {"w": "mal", "ini": 25.82, "fin": 26.26}, {"w": "asignados,", "ini": 26.26, "fin": 26.86}, {"w": "en", "ini": 26.86, "fin": 27.16}, {"w": "asignarlos", "ini": 27.16, "fin": 27.72}, {"w": "bien.", "ini": 27.72, "fin": 28.0}]}, {"ini": 28.0, "fin": 31.48, "texto": "El poco crecimiento, en crecimiento económico.", "palabras": [{"w": "El", "ini": 28.0, "fin": 28.74}, {"w": "poco", "ini": 28.74, "fin": 28.98}, {"w": "crecimiento,", "ini": 28.98, "fin": 29.76}, {"w": "en", "ini": 29.76, "fin": 30.1}, {"w": "crecimiento", "ini": 30.1, "fin": 30.8}, {"w": "económico.", "ini": 30.8, "fin": 31.48}]}, {"ini": 31.68, "fin": 35.06, "texto": "Y el daño ambiental, en sostenibilidad ambiental.", "palabras": [{"w": "Y", "ini": 31.68, "fin": 31.98}, {"w": "el", "ini": 31.98, "fin": 32.1}, {"w": "daño", "ini": 32.1, "fin": 32.34}, {"w": "ambiental,", "ini": 32.34, "fin": 32.96}, {"w": "en", "ini": 32.96, "fin": 33.36}, {"w": "sostenibilidad", "ini": 33.36, "fin": 34.12}, {"w": "ambiental.", "ini": 34.12, "fin": 35.06}]}, {"ini": 35.66, "fin": 41.72, "texto": "Ahora fíjate en cuatro: inflación, desempleo, déficit fiscal y déficit externo.", "palabras": [{"w": "Ahora", "ini": 35.66, "fin": 35.9}, {"w": "fíjate", "ini": 35.9, "fin": 36.34}, {"w": "en", "ini": 36.34, "fin": 36.48}, {"w": "cuatro:", "ini": 36.48, "fin": 36.74}, {"w": "inflación,", "ini": 37.4, "fin": 38.0}, {"w": "desempleo,", "ini": 38.44, "fin": 39.12}, {"w": "déficit", "ini": 39.42, "fin": 39.84}, {"w": "fiscal", "ini": 39.84, "fin": 40.24}, {"w": "y", "ini": 40.24, "fin": 40.6}, {"w": "déficit", "ini": 40.6, "fin": 41.12}, {"w": "externo.", "ini": 41.12, "fin": 41.72}]}, {"ini": 42.18, "fin": 46.48, "texto": "Los cuatro comparten un mismo objetivo: estabilizar la economía.", "palabras": [{"w": "Los", "ini": 42.18, "fin": 42.3}, {"w": "cuatro", "ini": 42.3, "fin": 42.7}, {"w": "comparten", "ini": 42.7, "fin": 43.28}, {"w": "un", "ini": 43.28, "fin": 43.64}, {"w": "mismo", "ini": 43.64, "fin": 44.0}, {"w": "objetivo:", "ini": 44.0, "fin": 44.48}, {"w": "estabilizar", "ini": 45.0, "fin": 45.74}, {"w": "la", "ini": 45.74, "fin": 45.94}, {"w": "economía.", "ini": 45.94, "fin": 46.48}]}, {"ini": 46.9, "fin": 51.74, "texto": "Del problema sale el objetivo. Sigue: ¿con qué perillas se persigue?", "palabras": [{"w": "Del", "ini": 46.9, "fin": 47.1}, {"w": "problema", "ini": 47.1, "fin": 47.56}, {"w": "sale", "ini": 47.56, "fin": 48.14}, {"w": "el", "ini": 48.14, "fin": 48.3}, {"w": "objetivo.", "ini": 48.3, "fin": 48.58}, {"w": "Sigue:", "ini": 49.36, "fin": 49.68}, {"w": "¿con", "ini": 50.3, "fin": 50.42}, {"w": "qué", "ini": 50.42, "fin": 50.66}, {"w": "perillas", "ini": 50.66, "fin": 51.08}, {"w": "se", "ini": 51.08, "fin": 51.3}, {"w": "persigue?", "ini": 51.3, "fin": 51.74}]}]}